Unless otherwise approved by the TD or TM , it is prohibited to replace the Standard Seat .

It is permitted to add padding to the head rest provided:

The foam used for the padding is the same material as used on the head rest;

The padding is properly affixed to the Seat , subject to the satisfaction of the TD .

The removal or modification of the Standard Seat mounting (track) is prohibited.

It is permitted to fit a foam insert between the Seat and the Driver provided the foam insert:

Complies with the requirements of FIA Appendix J Article 253-16;

Is constructed from a fireproof material, or covered in fireproof material;

Is black in colour; and

Is approved by the TD .

