Only the following components may be added to the Cockpit of an Automobile , provided the component does not hinder the Driver's visibility or ability to exit the Cockpit ; and the method of mounting is able to withstand a deceleration of 30g in any direction:

Authorised Driver comfort aids;

Radio communication equipment;

Judicial camera unit;

In-car signage board & bracket, and;

In-car camera/s and associated equipment as supplied by the Event Broadcaster.

